      "text": "c. End of pipe is below liquid level",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 310.867,
        "x1": 188.055,
        "bottom": 320.326
      },
      "reading_order": 51,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0052",
      "text": "inadvertently be started while work is being done",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 318.877,
        "x1": 518.085,
        "bottom": 327.877
      },
      "reading_order": 52,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0053",
      "text": "Check discharge piping to be sure:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 325.217,
        "x1": 188.064,
        "bottom": 334.217
      },
      "reading_order": 53,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0054",
      "text": "8.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 325.676,
        "x1": 43.506,
        "bottom": 334.676
      },
      "reading_order": 54,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0055",
      "text": "on the pump.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 329.627,
        "x1": 376.533,
        "bottom": 338.627
      },
      "reading_order": 55,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0056",
      "text": "a. It is all connected and tight",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 339.567,
        "x1": 169.56,
        "bottom": 349.026
      },
      "reading_order": 56,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0057",
      "text": "3. The pump has been allowed to cool down to the point",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 343.977,
        "x1": 537.12,
        "bottom": 353.436
      },
      "reading_order": 57,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0058",
      "text": "b. Valves are open",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 353.917,
        "x1": 127.366,
        "bottom": 363.376
      },
      "reading_order": 58,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0059",
      "text": "where there is no chance of anyone being burned.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 354.727,
        "x1": 524.115,
        "bottom": 363.727
      },
      "reading_order": 59,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0060",
      "text": "c. There is a place for the liquid to go",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 368.267,
        "x1": 201.069,
        "bottom": 377.726
      },
      "reading_order": 60,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0061",
      "text": "If trouble does develop, one of the first steps toward finding",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 369.077,
        "x1": 546.129,
        "bottom": 378.077
      },
      "reading_order": 61,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0062",
      "text": "the difficulty is to install a vacuum gauge in the suction port",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 379.827,
        "x1": 544.887,
        "bottom": 388.827
      },
      "reading_order": 62,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0063",
      "text": "9. Lubricate any grease fitting on the pump using a #2 NLGI",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 382.617,
        "x1": 277.623,
        "bottom": 392.076
      },
      "reading_order": 63,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0064",
      "text": "and a pressure gauge in the discharge port. Readings on",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 390.577,
        "x1": 537.645,
        "bottom": 399.577
      },
      "reading_order": 64,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0065",
      "text": "grease. Check any gear reducer, motor, coupling, etc.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 393.367,
        "x1": 263.116,
        "bottom": 402.367
      },
      "reading_order": 65,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0066",
      "text": "these gauges often will give a clue as to where to start looking",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 401.327,
        "x1": 557.622,
        "bottom": 410.327
      },
      "reading_order": 66,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0067",
      "text": "for instructions and lubricate as recommended by the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 404.117,
        "x1": 261.09,
        "bottom": 413.117
      },
      "reading_order": 67,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0068",
      "text": "for the trouble.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 412.077,
        "x1": 368.532,
        "bottom": 421.077
      },
      "reading_order": 68,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0069",
      "text": "manufacturer. See Engineering Service Bulletin",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 414.867,
        "x1": 247.583,
        "bottom": 424.326
      },
      "reading_order": 69,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0070",
      "text": "ESB-515 at the end of the Appendix for Viking standard",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 425.617,
        "x1": 274.442,
        "bottom": 435.076
      },
      "reading_order": 70,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0071",
      "text": "VACUUM GAUGE - SUCTION PORT",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.711,
        "top": 431.764,
        "x1": 516.644,
        "bottom": 443.764
      },
      "reading_order": 71,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0072",
      "text": "grease types to check compatibility.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 436.367,
        "x1": 190.9,
        "bottom": 445.367
      },
      "reading_order": 72,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0073",
      "text": "1. High reading would indicate:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 447.986,
        "x1": 447.021,
        "bottom": 456.986
      },
      "reading_order": 73,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0074",
      "text": "10. For packed pumps, loosen packing gland nuts so gland",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 450.717,
        "x1": 269.613,
        "bottom": 460.176
      },
      "reading_order": 74,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0075",
      "text": "can be moved slightly by hand. Adjust gland to reduce",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 461.467,
        "x1": 264.628,
        "bottom": 470.467
      },
      "reading_order": 75,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0076",
      "text": "a. Suction line is blocked by a stuck foot valve,",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 461.877,
        "x1": 513.081,
        "bottom": 471.336
      },
      "reading_order": 76,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0077",
      "text": "leakage only after pump has run long enough to reach",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 472.217,
        "x1": 265.122,
        "bottom": 481.217
      },
      "reading_order": 77,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0078",
      "text": "stuck gate valve, or plugged strainer.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 337.5,
        "top": 472.627,
        "x1": 484.086,
        "bottom": 481.627
      },
      "reading_order": 78,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0079",
      "text": "constant temperature. Packing should weep a little to keep",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 482.967,
        "x1": 282.618,
        "bottom": 491.967
      },
      "reading_order": 79,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0080",
      "text": "b. Liquid is too viscous to flow through the piping.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 486.977,
        "x1": 523.593,
        "bottom": 496.436
      },
      "reading_order": 80,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0081",
      "text": "it cool and lubricated.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 493.717,
        "x1": 134.541,
        "bottom": 502.717
      },
      "reading_order": 81,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0082",
      "text": "c. Lift is too high.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 501.327,
        "x1": 395.532,
        "bottom": 510.786
      },
      "reading_order": 82,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0083",
      "text": "Do not use the Viking pump to flush, pressure test or",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 508.067,
        "x1": 258.94,
        "bottom": 517.067
      },
      "reading_order": 83,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0084",
      "text": "11.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 508.526,
        "x1": 48.015,
        "bottom": 517.526
      },
      "reading_order": 84,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0085",
      "text": "d. Line is too small.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 515.677,
        "x1": 404.523,
        "bottom": 525.136
      },
      "reading_order": 85,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0086",
      "text": "prove the system with water. Either remove the pump or",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 518.817,
        "x1": 272.092,
        "bottom": 527.817
      },
      "reading_order": 86,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0087",
      "text": "run piping around it while flushing or testing. Pumping",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 529.567,
        "x1": 263.097,
        "bottom": 538.567
      },
      "reading_order": 87,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0088",
      "text": "2. Low reading would indicate:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 530.486,
        "x1": 445.023,
        "bottom": 539.486
      },
      "reading_order": 88,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0089",
      "text": "water, dirty or otherwise, can do more damage in a few",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 540.317,
        "x1": 268.093,
        "bottom": 549.317
      },
      "reading_order": 89,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0090",
      "text": "Air leak in suction line.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 337.5,
        "top": 544.377,
        "x1": 427.032,
        "bottom": 553.377
      },
      "reading_order": 90,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0091",
      "text": "a.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 544.836,
        "x1": 331.506,
        "bottom": 553.836
      },
      "reading_order": 91,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0092",
      "text": "minutes than months of normal service.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 551.067,
        "x1": 206.559,
        "bottom": 560.067
      },
      "reading_order": 92,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0093",
      "text": "b. End of pipe is not in liquid.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 558.727,
        "x1": 442.557,
        "bottom": 568.186
      },
      "reading_order": 93,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0094",
      "text": "Check to be sure all guards are in place.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 565.417,
        "x1": 210.573,
        "bottom": 574.417
      },
      "reading_order": 94,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0095",
      "text": "12.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 565.876,
        "x1": 48.51,
        "bottom": 574.876
      },
      "reading_order": 95,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0096",
      "text": "c. Pump is worn.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 573.077,
        "x1": 394.515,
        "bottom": 582.536
      },
      "reading_order": 96,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0097",
      "text": "13. Check the pump to be sure it is heated to operating",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 579.767,
        "x1": 253.611,
        "bottom": 589.226
      },
      "reading_order": 97,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0098",
      "text": "d. Pump is dry - should be primed.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 587.427,
        "x1": 464.544,
        "bottom": 596.886
      },
      "reading_order": 98,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0099",
      "text": "temperature (if jacketed or heat traced).",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.5,
        "top": 590.517,
        "x1": 207.567,
        "bottom": 599.517
      },
      "reading_order": 99,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0100",
      "text": "3. Fluttering, jumping, or erratic reading:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 602.236,
        "x1": 487.53,
        "bottom": 611.236
      },
      "reading_order": 100,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0101",
      "text": "If the pump begins to deliver liquid within 60 seconds, it",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 604.867,
        "x1": 256.104,
        "bottom": 613.867
      },
      "reading_order": 101,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0102",
      "text": "can continue to be operated. If liquid is not leaving the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 615.617,
        "x1": 251.127,
        "bottom": 624.617
      },
      "reading_order": 102,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0103",
      "text": "Liquid is vaporizing.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 337.5,
        "top": 616.127,
        "x1": 416.529,
        "bottom": 625.127
      },
      "reading_order": 103,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0104",
      "text": "a.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 616.586,
        "x1": 331.506,
        "bottom": 625.586
      },
      "reading_order": 104,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0105",
      "text": "discharge port, stop the pump. Running the pump longer than",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 626.367,
        "x1": 281.133,
        "bottom": 635.367
      },
      "reading_order": 105,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0106",
      "text": "b. Liquid is coming to pump in slugs, possibly an air leak,",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 630.477,
        "x1": 554.085,
        "bottom": 639.936
      },
      "reading_order": 106,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0107",
      "text": "one minute without liquid inside it can damage the pump.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 637.117,
        "x1": 262.611,
        "bottom": 646.117
      },
      "reading_order": 107,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0108",
      "text": "insufficient liquid above the end of the suction pipe.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 337.5,
        "top": 641.227,
        "x1": 540.956,
        "bottom": 650.227
      },
      "reading_order": 108,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0109",
      "text": "Review the steps just outlined, consider what the suction",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 647.867,
        "x1": 261.603,
        "bottom": 656.867
      },
      "reading_order": 109,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0110",
      "text": "c. Vibrating from cavitation, misalignment,",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 655.577,
        "x1": 494.387,
        "bottom": 665.036
      },
      "reading_order": 110,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0111",
      "text": "and discharge gauges indicate, and see Troubleshooting",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 658.617,
        "x1": 268.121,
        "bottom": 668.076
      },
      "reading_order": 111,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0112",
      "text": "or damaged parts.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 337.5,
        "top": 666.327,
        "x1": 410.535,
        "bottom": 675.327
      },
      "reading_order": 112,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0113",
      "text": "section. If everything appears to be in order, put some liquid",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 669.367,
        "x1": 274.133,
        "bottom": 678.367
      },
      "reading_order": 113,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0114",
      "text": "in the pump. This will help it prime.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 680.117,
        "x1": 173.882,
        "bottom": 689.117
      },
      "reading_order": 114,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0115",
      "text": "The pump can be restarted. If nothing is flowing within two",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 694.467,
        "x1": 267.606,
        "bottom": 703.467
      },
      "reading_order": 115,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0116",
      "text": "minutes, stop the pump. The pump is not a compressor; it will",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 705.217,
        "x1": 280.432,
        "bottom": 714.217
      },
      "reading_order": 116,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0117",
      "text": "not build up much air pressure. It may be necessary to vent",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 715.967,
        "x1": 272.106,
        "bottom": 724.967
      },
      "reading_order": 117,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0016:b0118",
      "text": "the discharge line until liquid begins to flow.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 726.717,
        "x1": 208.61,
        "bottom": 735.717
